"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
3077,"**
Narrated to us Bishr ibn Hilal who said: Narrated to us Abd al-Warith ibn Sa'id al-'Anbari, on the authority of 'Amir al-Ahwal, on the authority of Bakr ibn 'Abd Allah al-Muzani, on the authority of Ibn 'Abbas (RA) who said:

The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) intended to perform Hajj. A woman said to her husband, ""Let me perform Hajj with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)."" He replied, ""I do not have anything with which I can take you for Hajj."" She said, ""Then let me perform Hajj on your riding camel."" He said, ""That is used by me and my child."" She said, ""Then let me perform Hajj on so-and-so's camel."" He said, ""That is held in trust for the cause of Allah."" She said, ""Then sell your dates."" He said, ""That is my and your sustenance.""

When the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) returned from Makkah, her husband sent her to him. She said, ""Convey my greetings and the mercy of Allah to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), and ask him what equals performing Hajj with him.""

So her husband came to the Prophet (ﷺ) and said, ""O Messenger of Allah, my wife sends her greetings and the mercy of Allah to you. She had asked me to take her for Hajj with you. I told her I did not have anything with which I could take her for Hajj. She said, 'Then let me perform Hajj on your riding camel.' I told her that is used by me and my child. She said, 'Then let me perform Hajj on so-and-so's camel.' I told her that is held in trust for the cause of Allah. The Prophet (ﷺ) said, 'If you had taken her for Hajj, it would have been in the cause of Allah.' She said, 'Then let me perform Hajj on your riding camel.' I told her that is used by me and my child. She said, 'Then sell your dates.' I told her that is my and your sustenance.""

The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) laughed in amazement at her eagerness for Hajj. Then she instructed me to ask you what equals performing Hajj with you. He (ﷺ) said: ""Convey my greetings and the mercy of Allah to her, and inform her that performing 'Umrah in Ramadan is equivalent to Hajj with me.""

---"
